{"id":"soft_dtw_divergence","title":"Soft-DTW divergence","family":"elastic","definition":"reference","intro_en":"The corrected soft-DTW divergence subtracts self-alignment terms from the cross-series soft score. This removes its nonzero self-cost by construction. The animation shows both the diffuse alignment occupancy and the three-term correction; theoretical nonnegativity and identification results depend on the ground-cost assumptions.","intro_zh":"修正 soft-DTW 散度从交叉序列分数中扣除两个自对齐项，因此相同输入的自代价按构造归零。动图展示分散的对齐占据权重和三项修正；非负性与可识别性的理论结论依赖局部代价条件。","steps_en":["Form the squared local discrepancy table and choose gamma=0.7.","Use -gamma*log(sum(exp(-previous/gamma))) in each DP update.","Propagate derivatives backward to display expected alignment occupancy across multiple paths.","Subtract half of softDTW(x,x) and half of softDTW(y,y)."],"steps_zh":["构造平方局部误差表，设平滑参数 gamma=0.7。","每步动态规划使用 -gamma*log(sum(exp(-previous/gamma)))。","反向传播导数，显示多个路径共同形成的期望对齐占据权重。","分别扣除 softDTW(x,x) 和 softDTW(y,y) 的一半。"],"formula":"D_gamma(x,y)=sDTW_gamma(x,y)-0.5*sDTW_gamma(x,x)-0.5*sDTW_gamma(y,y)","caveats_en":["Gamma controls the spread over alignments; this example uses squared local costs and no path band.","A divergence is not automatically a metric; its properties depend on the ground cost and it need not satisfy the triangle inequality."],"caveats_zh":["Gamma 控制路径权重的分散程度；本例使用平方局部代价，不加路径窗口。","散度并不自动成为度量；其性质依赖局部代价，也不必满足三角不等式。"],"sources":[{"label":"Cuturi and Blondel (2017): Soft-DTW","url":"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v70/cuturi17a.html"},{"label":"Blondel, Mensch and Vert (2021): corrected divergences","url":"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v130/blondel21a.html"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"gamma":0.7,"local_cost":"squared Euclidean","self_x":-4.542304721573488,"self_y":-4.93660871304499,"cross":-4.4439633238876635},"result":{"label":"divergence","value":0.2954933934215749,"detail":"The explicit definition and parameters shown on this card."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Compare samples to construct the local table","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Local comparison costs","z":[[0.010000000000000002,0.009999999999999995,0.09,1.0,5.76,8.41,4.409999999999998,0.8100000000000003,0.0,0.25],[0.09000000000000002,0.010000000000000007,0.009999999999999995,0.6399999999999999,4.840000000000001,7.290000000000001,3.61,0.4900000000000001,0.04000000000000001,0.48999999999999994],[1.0,0.6400000000000001,0.3600000000000001,0.009999999999999974,2.25,4.0,1.4399999999999993,0.0,0.8100000000000003,1.9600000000000004],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"row_label":"x index","col_label":"y index","cursor":[2,0]}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Compare samples to construct the local table","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Local comparison costs","z":[[0.010000000000000002,0.009999999999999995,0.09,1.0,5.76,8.41,4.409999999999998,0.8100000000000003,0.0,0.25],[0.09000000000000002,0.010000000000000007,0.009999999999999995,0.6399999999999999,4.840000000000001,7.290000000000001,3.61,0.4900000000000001,0.04000000000000001,0.48999999999999994],[1.0,0.6400000000000001,0.3600000000000001,0.009999999999999974,2.25,4.0,1.4399999999999993,0.0,0.8100000000000003,1.9600000000000004],[5.289999999999999,4.41,3.61,1.44,0.04000000000000007,0.49000000000000027,0.010000000000000018,1.6899999999999995,4.839999999999999,7.289999999999998],[9.610000000000001,8.410000000000002,7.290000000000001,4.0,0.3600000000000001,0.010000000000000018,0.8100000000000006,4.41,9.0,12.25],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null